WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.870 --> 00:00:05.870
Accessibility at Dudley Park Aquatic Centre
has been given a lift with the installation

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:10.400
of a new hoist and change table in the facilities
accessible changing rooms.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:16.090
The $20,000 equipment is designed to allow
pool users with limited mobility to move more

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:20.040
easily between the shower equipment, toilet
and their wheelchair.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:26.140
It means better accessibility to what's available
for everybody else, so if you want to come

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:28.320
for a swim, you can come for a swim.

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:34.100
The new motorised change table can also be
used for showering, it's height adjustable

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:36.239
and has a rail for safety.

00:00:36.239 --> 00:00:41.359
Children have be known to have to be to changed
on the floor previously, but now we've got

00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:48.620
the bed, they can go onto the bed and they've
got the safety rail to prevent them from falling.

00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:57.060
We had a situation where those who had access
issues were having to change in a semi-public area

00:00:57.060 --> 00:01:05.140
It just wasn't an equitable situation, so
providing this facility in an area that can

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:12.480
be closed off and become private is absolutely
essential in our view to equality of access.

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:17.820
The centre also has a poolside hydraulic chair
and a dedicated wet wheelchair which allows

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:21.980
wheelchair users to use ramp access to better
enjoy the pool.

00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:26.970
Councillor Peter Allen says this is a result
of the council’s ongoing dedication towards

00:01:26.970 --> 00:01:32.160
ensuring the region’s public facilities
are enjoyed by all residents.

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:38.880
For example we're looking at our camping grounds
in our district and wanting to ensure that

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:43.480
any review of those camping grounds deals
with access issues which might have been overlooked

00:01:43.480 --> 00:01:45.490
in the past.

00:01:45.490 --> 00:01:50.110
And Jill expects that the newly improved changing
room will see use of the pools increase from

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:52.780
those with accessibility requirements.

00:01:52.780 --> 00:01:59.280
That would be the goal, to make it more accessible
for everybody, so everybody in our community

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:03.780
has the same access to the same facilities,
to do the same things.

